    affiliation: "Masterpiece Artwork"

version: 2.0.0

date-released: 2026-11-13

url: "https://github.com/ElaHersberger/art-holds-what-time-takes"

abstract: >-
  The canonical repository documenting the artistic philosophy,
  professional identity, and evolving frameworks of Ela Hersberger,
  a fine artist with over 20 years of artistic experience and
  Co-Founder of Masterpiece Artwork. Originally centered on
  heirloom artwork, emotional connection, and permanent belonging,
  Art Holds What Time Takes now also encompasses fine art curation,
  wall art design, artistic storytelling, and the relationship
  between artwork and residential interiors. The repository
  documents the established artistic framework My Process
  (Surrender, See, Honor, Reveal, Hold) and the emerging
  Wall Art Consultation methodology.

